stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: createTender() [by PSU Officer]

    Created --> UnderEvaluation: openBids() [by Keeper when now >= openingTime]
    Created --> Cancelled: cancelTender() [by PSU Officer]

    state UnderEvaluation {
        [*] --> BidsOpened
        BidsOpened --> BidsRevealed: revealBid() [by Vendor when now <= revealDeadline]
        BidsRevealed --> TechnicallyEvaluated: setTechnicalScore() [by PSU Officer]
        TechnicallyEvaluated --> AwardReady: All bids scored
    }

    UnderEvaluation --> Awarded: awardTender() [by PSU Officer: L1 Enforcement strictly verified]
    UnderEvaluation --> Cancelled: cancelTender() [by PSU Officer]

    Awarded --> Disputed: disputeTender() [by Vendor with 0.01 ETH Bond within 7-day standstill]
    Awarded --> Finalized: finalizeTender() [by Keeper when standstill expired (>7 days) & no active dispute]

    state Disputed {
        [*] --> GrievanceUnderReview
        GrievanceUnderReview --> Upheld: resolveDispute(upheld=true) [by CVC Auditor]
        GrievanceUnderReview --> Dismissed: resolveDispute(upheld=false) [by CVC Auditor]
        GrievanceUnderReview --> TimeoutDismissed: resolveDisputeTimeout() [Anyone when CVC inactive >14 days]
    }

    Upheld --> UnderEvaluation: Winner reset, award revoked, bond refunded
    Dismissed --> Awarded: Bond forfeited to treasury, standstill resumes
    TimeoutDismissed --> Awarded: Bond refunded to vendor, standstill resumes

    Finalized --> [*]: _creditRefunds() executed; Vendors call withdraw()
    Cancelled --> [*]: _creditRefunds() executed; Vendors call withdraw()
